Q: Parse a string formatted as &quot;word[number]&quot; into an associative array A: <pre><code>$arr = [];
$getValue = "status[30]";

if (preg_match('#(\w+)\[(\w+)\]#', $getValue, $matches))
    $arr[$matches[1]] = $matches[2];

print_r($arr);
</code></pre>

<p>Output:</p>

<pre><code>Array
(
    [status] =&gt; 30
)
</code></pre>
